.TH CUT_WAIT_S 3 "generalGameEngine" "Engine Manual" "Engine Manual"
.SH NAME
CUT_WAIT_S \- CutStep initializer: pause the cutscene for sec seconds
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include \(dqcutscene.h\(dq
.ft B
#define CUT_WAIT_S(sec) { .kind = CUT_WAIT, .duration = (sec) }
.ft R
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
CutStep initializer: pause the cutscene for sec seconds. Expands to a brace initializer, so it goes directly inside a CutStep array initializer, or becomes a value with a cast: (CutStep)CUT_WAIT_S(0.5f).
.SH MODULE
cutscene (src/engine/cutscene/cutscene.h)
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR CutStep (3),
.BR cutscene_start (3),
.BR gge\-api (7),
.BR gge (1)
